---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Insurance & Rates | CC Counseling"
  description="How insurance and self-pay work at CC Counseling — coverage depends on your clinician and plan."
>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="bg-canvas py-14 lg:py-20" aria-labelledby="insurance-hero-heading">
      <div class="section-px mx-auto max-w-site">
        <h1
          id="insurance-hero-heading"
          class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl"
        >
          Insurance & Rates
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Whether your insurance can be used depends on the clinician you work with and the health plans that clinician participates in.
          Before you begin, we can help you understand what may apply to you.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-b border-line bg-paper py-16 sm:py-24" aria-label="Insurance and rates details">
      <div class="section-px mx-auto max-w-site">
        <div
          class="mt-0 max-w-2xl space-y-5 text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-muted [&_a]:font-medium [&_a]:text-sageDark [&_a]:underline [&_a]:decoration-sand [&_a]:underline-offset-4 [&_a]:transition-colors hover:[&_a]:text-clay hover:[&_a]:decoration-clay"
        >
          <p>
            When you reach out, we can walk through whether your plan is likely to be usable with your clinician match, what
            benefits verification may involve, and expected out-of-pocket costs. If insurance does not apply, we will explain
            self-pay so you can decide with clear numbers.
          </p>
          <p>
            Carrier lists and fee schedules on this page are updated when details change. To get information that matches your
            situation, contact us with your plan name and what you are looking for.
          </p>
          <p>
            <a href="/contact-get-started">Get Started</a> · <a href="/">Back to home</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
